/*
 * **Unknown module stats** — the absences in `modules-*.jsonc` that mean *we do not
 * know this value*, as opposed to *the module has no such stat*.
 *
 * Basis: the findings of the 2026-08-02 module-stat reconciliation against
 *        EDCD/coriolis-data, modules/** (https://github.com/EDCD/coriolis-data) and
 *        EDSY eddb.js (taleden, CC BY-NC 4.0: https://github.com/taleden/EDSY) —
 *        neither registry carries a value for the fields named here. No source was
 *        re-acquired for this file: the classification (revision 2026-08-05) is this
 *        repository's own work, and no figure is reproduced from either registry.
 *        The module symbols and field names are Elite Dangerous game data, property
 *        of Frontier Developments plc, redistributed under Frontier's media-usage
 *        terms: https://forums.frontier.co.uk/threads/510879/
 *
 * A stat field is simply absent from a module record whether the game has no such stat
 * for it — a cargo rack draws no power — or no source publishes the one it does have.
 * Both read as `undefined`, so a calculation cannot tell "nothing to add" from "cannot
 * be answered", and the second silently becomes zero. This file names the second kind.
 *
 * Each entry is a module `symbol` from `modules-*.jsonc` and the `stats` fields whose
 * absence there means *unknown*. A field listed here must be absent from the module's
 * record: filling one in from a real source means deleting it here in the same change.
 *
 * Deliberately narrow. `cost` needs no entry — every module without a `cost` is one
 * with no published price, so absence there is already unambiguous (README, "list
 * prices"). And this is not a claim that every absence *not* listed here is a stat the
 * game does not have: the base stats that blueprints need and no record carries are a
 * separate, larger gap tracked in `TODO.md`.
 *
 * Full provenance, and what would fill each of these: data/ships/SOURCES.md.
 */
[
  {
    "symbol": "Int_StellarBodyDiscoveryScanner_Standard",
    "stats": ["powerDraw"]
  },
  {
    "symbol": "Int_StellarBodyDiscoveryScanner_Standard_free",
    "stats": ["powerDraw"]
  },
  {
    "symbol": "Int_StellarBodyDiscoveryScanner_Intermediate",
    "stats": ["powerDraw"]
  },
  {
    "symbol": "Int_StellarBodyDiscoveryScanner_Advanced",
    "stats": ["powerDraw"]
  },
  {
    "symbol": "Int_DroneControl_ResourceSiphon",
    "stats": ["mass"]
  }
]
